<TABLE width=100% border=0 cellpadding=4 cellspacing=0><TR><TD width=5>　</TD><TD width=100% valign=top><font color="000080"><br>7/19 dok raidの戦利品です。<br>いまさらなものから、今でもすげーものまで<br>いろいろあります。<br>ぜひ振っていってくださいませ。<br><br>*[01][05][09]は上位2番目までの人がgetできます。<br>**番号を振り忘れた方は[01]に振ったものとします。<br><br><br>[01]<br>　zeni<br>　1st 1000pp<br>　2nd 413pp 2gp 7sp 3cp<br><br>[02]<br>　Argent Protector<br>　<a href=http://www.magelo.com/eq_item_info.html?num=5840 target=_blank>http://www.magelo.com/eq_item_info.html?num=5840</a><br>　2H Slashing  Atk Delay: 49 DMG: 42  AC: 10<br>　STR: +10  WIS: +10  INT: +10  HP: +25 MANA: +25  <br>　WT: 10.0    Size: LARGE<br>　Class: WAR PAL RNG SHD <br>　Race: ALL<br><br>[03]<br>　Argent Defender<br>　<a href=http://www.magelo.com/eq_item_info.html?num=5622 target=_blank>http://www.magelo.com/eq_item_info.html?num=5622</a><br>　Skill: 2H Slashing  Atk Delay: 49<br>　DMG: 33  <br>　MANA: +20  <br>　WT: 10.0    Size: LARGE<br>　Class: WAR PAL RNG SHD <br>　Race: ALL<br><br>[04]<br>　Di'zok Imperial Katana<br>　<a href=http://www.magelo.com/eq_item_info.html?num=5708 target=_blank>http://www.magelo.com/eq_item_info.html?num=5708</a><br>　Skill: 2H Slashing  Atk Delay: 43<br>　DMG: 35  <br>　STR: +12  WIS: +5  INT: +5  MANA: +30  <br>　SV DISEASE: +5  SV MAGIC: +5  SV POISON: +5<br>　WT:  0.5    Size: MEDIUM<br>　Class: WAR PAL RNG SHD <br>　Race: ALL<br><br>[05]<br>　1st Sarnak Battle Shield<br>　2nd Sarnak Battle Shield<br>　<a href=http://www.magelo.com/eq_item_info.html?num=9205 target=_blank>http://www.magelo.com/eq_item_info.html?num=9205</a><br>　AC: 25<br>　STR: +5  STA: +5  HP: +40  SV FIRE: +10  <br>　SV COLD: +10  SV MAGIC: +10  <br>　WT:  3.0    Size: MEDIUM<br>　Class: WAR CLR PAL RNG SHD DRU BRD SHM <br>　Race: ALL<br><br>[06]<br>　Stained Cloth Mask<br>　Slot: FACE  <br>　AC: 6<br>　Charges: 10<br>　CHA: +4  HP: +20  MANA: +20  SV DISEASE: +5  <br>　SV POISON: +5<br>　Effect: Ultravision (Must Equip. Casting Time: 5.0)<br>　WT:  3.0    Size: SMALL<br>　Class: ALL<br>　Race: ALL<br><br>[07]<br>　Coin of Xev<br>　Gift of Xev - Coin of Xev + Words of Restraint<br>　Quiver of Marr - Coin of Xev + Words of Domination<br><br>[08]<br>　Breath of Ro <br>　Breast Etched Swatch - A Piece of Parchment + A Quill + Breath of Ro<br><br>[09]<br>　1st Sarnak Blood<br>　2nd Sarnak Blood<br>　<a href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/quest.html?quest=2203 target=_blank>http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/quest.html?quest=2203</a> [Quest]<br>　Scale Temper - Sarnak Blood + Iksar Blood + Froglok Blood + Flask of Bloodwater<br><br>[10]<br>　Part of Finnok's Treatise Pg. 2 (right side) <br>　ENC 55pet - Part of Finnok's Treatise Pg. 2(R+L) + A Piece of Parchment + A Quill<br><br>[11]<br>　Part of Zeannor's Thesis Pg. 15<br>　for ENC 58DD<br><br>[12]<br>　Part of Yaeth's Compendium Pg. 82<br>　for ENC 57Enlightenment<br><br>[13]<br>　Words of Comprehension<br>　for Spell: Hammer of Souls / Spell: Infusion / Spell: Shadowbond<br><br>[14]<br>　Rune of Incitement<br>　Spell: Disintegrate / Spell: Manasink / Spell: Spellshield / Spell: Yaulp IV<br><br><br>参加者一覧(敬称略)<br>Lurche Erit Rydan Tokageto Kiririn Watatumi<br>Cocotto Kirian Funyara Iwashi Minimarie<br>Deizy Ponkotsu Lyrwin (Lifa) (Miyuki)<br><br>thx<br><B></B><P align=right>開示日：2003/07/27<BR>開示後のROLL：無効</P></font></TD><TD nowrap valign=top>
